nt pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.94<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 31, 2016<br/>Summer Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20160425152456&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vibrant_Egg_111d14.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a vibrant egg.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 8.50 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It is of dark blue and turquoise colour and pulses steadily. It seems that something is moving inside.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Use this item to receive the <a href=\"#/wiki/Sparkion%20%28Mount%29\">Sparkion (Mount)</a>. <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sparkion%20%28Mount%29\"><img alt=\"Sparkion (Mount)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sparkion_Mount_90aacc.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You receive the permission to ride a sparkion.</span>\n</p><p>It's obtained through the <a href=\"#/quest/heart-of-destruction-quest\">Heart of Destruction Quest</a>, however you <b>don't</b> need to do the quest to use the egg and obtain the mount.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"><